      <title>把日子拍成照片，把照片写成代码</title>
      <link href="/blog/2026/08/01/hello-liquid-glass/"/>
      <url>/blog/2026/08/01/hello-liquid-glass/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>这是「拾光小记」的一篇示例文章，顺便把博客的几个新能力都演示一遍：照片灯箱预览、微信式放大缩小、代码高亮和一键复制，还有可以在设置里切换的液态玻璃新样式。</p><h2 id="一组随手拍"><a href="#一组随手拍" class="headerlink" title="一组随手拍"></a>一组随手拍</h2><p>照片是博客的主角。点任何一张都能打开灯箱放大看，右上角有放大、缩小和关闭按钮，双指或滚轮也能缩放。</p><p><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/photo-a/1200/800" alt="清晨的窗台，光线很软"></p><p><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/photo-b/1200/800" alt="街角的咖啡店"></p><p><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/photo-c/1200/800" alt="傍晚的河边，有人在遛狗"></p><p><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/photo-d/1200/800" alt="山顶俯瞰，云层很低"></p><p>翻到下一张时，相邻的图片已经在后台预加载好了，所以切换几乎是即时的。</p><h2 id="一段代码"><a href="#一段代码" class="headerlink" title="一段代码"></a>一段代码</h2><p>博客也支持代码展示。下面这段 JavaScript 右上角有个「复制」按钮，点一下就能把代码拷走：</p><figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 把当前时间格式化成 &quot;HH:mm&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">now</span>(<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">const</span> d = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">Date</span>();</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">const</span> <span class="title function_">pad</span> = (<span class="params">n</span>) =&gt; <span class="title class_">String</span>(n).<span class="title function_">padStart</span>(<span class="number">2</span>, <span class="string">&quot;0&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="string">`<span class="subst">$&#123;pad(d.getHours())&#125;</span>:<span class="subst">$&#123;pad(d.getMinutes())&#125;</span>`</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">`现在是 <span class="subst">$&#123;now()&#125;</span>`</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>再来一段样式，看看 CSS 高亮和玻璃面板的搭配：</p><figure class="highlight css"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="selector-class">.glass</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attribute">background</span>: <span class="built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="number">255</span>, <span class="number">255</span>, <span class="number">255</span>, <span class="number">0.5</span>);</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attribute">backdrop-filter</span>: <span class="built_in">blur</span>(<span class="number">24px</span>) <span class="built_in">saturate</span>(<span class="number">180%</span>);</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attribute">border</span>: <span class="number">1px</span> solid <span class="built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="number">255</span>, <span class="number">255</span>, <span class="number">255</span>, <span class="number">0.45</span>);</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attribute">border-radius</span>: <span class="number">24px</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="关于液态玻璃"><a href="#关于液态玻璃" class="headerlink" title="关于液态玻璃"></a>关于液态玻璃</h2><p>点右上角的齿轮图标打开「设置」，把「新版页面」的开关打开，整个站点就会切换到仿 iOS 的液态玻璃样式：半透磨砂的卡片、能折射背景环境光的导航栏、胶囊形的按钮。这个偏好会写进 Cookie，下次来也记得。</p><blockquote><p>小提示：液态玻璃和深色模式可以自由组合，夜晚的玻璃会更沉、更冷一点。</p></blockquote><h2 id="写在最后"><a href="#写在最后" class="headerlink" title="写在最后"></a>写在最后</h2><p>模板就演示到这里。以后的这里，会放真正的照片和故事。</p>]]></content>
      
      
